      <p begin="02:38.580" end="02:41.820" ttm:agent="v1">Back off of my fella, Gabriela</p>
      <p begin="02:41.820" end="02:45.040" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Back off, Gabriela-la-la (oh, Gabriela)</p>
      <p begin="02:45.040" end="02:49.920" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause, ooh, you could have anyone else you wanted to</p>
      <p begin="02:49.920" end="02:51.710" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I'm begging you (I'm begging you, hey)</p>
